span><span class=\"author-p-75958\">0 Robocop (Ocean 1988)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid285\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-85466\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> WEC Le Mans (Imagine 1988)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid288\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-85466\">2</span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> Satan (Dinamic, 1989)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid291\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-85466\">3</span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> Rick Dangerous II (Micro Style, 1990)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid294\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-85466\">4</span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> Stunt Car Racer (Micro Style, 1990</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid297\" class=\"\"> <span class=\"author-p-75958\">1</span><span class=\"author-p-85466\">5</span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> Super Cauldron /Titus 1992)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid303\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.cpcwiki.eu/index.php/Main_Page\">http://www.cpcwiki.eu/index.php/Main_Page</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid304\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.zock.com/8-Bit/D_CPC464.HTML\">http://www.zock.com/8-Bit/D_CPC464.HTML</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid305\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid306\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid307\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.cpcgamereviews.com\">http://www.cpcgamereviews.com</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid308\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://tacgr.emuunlim.com/\">http://tacgr.emuunlim.com/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid309\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.cpc-power.com/\">http://www.cpc-power.com/</a></span><span class=\"author-p-75958\">   </span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">detailierte infos/anleitungen/screenshots/covers zu den games</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid310\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid311\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">emulatoren</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid312\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.winape.net/downloads.jsp\">http://www.winape.net/downloads.jsp</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> &#8211; WinApe die nr.1 der emulatoren</span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid313\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.cpcbox.com/\">http://www.cpcbox.com/</a></span><span class=\"author-p-75958\">   </span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">&#8211; laeuft im browser games direkt spielbar aber bei mir kein sound</span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid314\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.arnimedes.de/download.html\">http://www.arnimedes.de/download.html</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid315\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://arnold.emuunlim.com/\">http://arnold.emuunlim.com/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid316\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid317\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">firmengeschichte</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid318\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://8bit-museum.de/heimcomputer/amstrad/\">https://8bit-museum.de/heimcomputer/amstrad/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid319\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.theregister.co.uk/2014/02/12/archaeologic_amstrad_cpc_464/\">http://www.theregister.co.uk/2014/02/12/archaeologic_amstrad_cpc_464/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid320\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Ruthless:  The Story of Amstrad and Alan Sugar in the 80&#8217;s and 90&#8217;s &#8211; Kim Justice   </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid321\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiIXn9Tr5hI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiIXn9Tr5hI</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid322\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid323\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">specials</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid324\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.cpcwiki.eu/index.php/Clones\">http://www.cpcwiki.eu/index.php/Clones</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">es gab einen DDR nachbau des cpc464 und ein russisches geraet</span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid325\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://cpccrackers.free.fr/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=category&amp;id=16&amp;Itemid=153\">http://cpccrackers.free.fr/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=category&amp;id=16&amp;Itemid=153</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> &#8211; demos/crackerintros</span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid326\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.vintageisthenewold.com/heroes-rescue-new-game-for-amstrad-cpc-with-demo-available/\">http://www.vintageisthenewold.com/heroes-rescue-new-game-for-amstrad-cpc-with-demo-available/</a></span><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid327\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-85466 url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/803660556/colour-personal-computing-the-amstrad-cpc-fanzine?ref=thanks_tweet\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/803660556/colour-personal-computing-the-amstrad-cpc-fanzine?ref=thanks_tweet</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid371\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Wie geht es dem Hyper Sentinel Kickstarter </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid372\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/robhwson/hyper-sentinel\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/robhwson/hyper-sentinel</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid378\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://club-hewson.mightybell.com/\">https://club-hewson.mightybell.com/</a></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid384\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">NES Kickstarter Buch wieder aktiv</span></div>\n<p><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/2146199819/nintendo-entertainment-system-famicom-a-visual-com\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/2146199819/nintendo-entertainment-system-famicom-a-visual-com</a></span></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid390\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Schoener Retro-Manga-Shooter als Kickstarter &#8222;Xydonia&#8220;</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid391\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/kickstarter-xydonia/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/kickstarter-xydonia/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid392\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid393\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Herbst 2017 neues Sonic Spiel</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid395\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://futurezone.at/games/sonic-mania-sega-bringt-zum-jubilaeum-neues-2d-spiel/211.563.430\">http://futurezone.at/games/sonic-mania-sega-bringt-zum-jubilaeum-neues-2d-spiel/211.563.430</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid396\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid397\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">&#8222;Neue&#8220; Nintendo Konsole MINI NES</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid398\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.mobilegeeks.de/video/nintendo-classic-mini-nes-erster-werbe-spot/\">http://www.mobilegeeks.de/video/nintendo-classic-mini-nes-erster-werbe-spot/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid399\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid400\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Sociable Soccer</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid402\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.computerbild.de/artikel/cbs-News-PC-Sociable-Soccer-16012061.html\">http://www.computerbild.de/artikel/cbs-News-PC-Sociable-Soccer-16012061.html</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid403\" class=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Akalabeth, also Ultima 0 wurde nun,  anscheinend mit Richard Garriotts  Zustimmung, auf den C64 portiert.</span></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid420\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.indieretronews.com/2016/08/akalabeth-world-of-doom-lord-british.html\">http://www.indieretronews.com/2016/08/akalabeth-world-of-doom-lord-british.html</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid421\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://archeogaming.blogspot.fr/2016/07/akalabeth-world-of-doom-for-commodore-64.html\">https://archeogaming.blogspot.fr/2016/07/akalabeth-world-of-doom-for-commodore-64.html</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid422\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Und als kleinen Hinweis:</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid423\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Die  Ultima Ableger  &#8222;Worlds of Ultima: The Savage Empire&#8220; und Ultima Worlds  of Adventure 2: Martian  Dreams gibt es dauerhaft kostenlos auf gog.com</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid424\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.gog.com/game/worlds_of_ultima_the_savage_empire\">https://www.gog.com/game/worlds_of_ultima_the_savage_empire</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.gog.com/game/ultima_worlds_of_adventure_2_martian_dreams\">https://www.gog.com/game/ultima_worlds_of_adventure_2_martian_dreams</a></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid430\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">c64 2016er spiel shotgung</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid432\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.c64-wiki.de/index.php/Shotgun\">https://www.c64-wiki.de/index.php/Shotgun</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid433\" class=\"\"></div>\n<p><span class=\"author-p-75958\">scumm update fuer c64 / moneky 2 und co moeglich ?</span></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid442\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.indieretronews.com/2016/07/scumm-mock-up-v014-monkey-island-2-on.html\">http://www.indieretronews.com/2016/07/scumm-mock-up-v014-monkey-island-2-on.html</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid443\" class=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8211;</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p>Naechste Sendung:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">voraussichtlich 19.08.2016</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">weitere Infos demnaechst hier.</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">LIVE auf mixlr.com/retrokompott</div>\n",
